@startuml
' System-context view: Lightning Bug and the actors/systems around it.
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #333333
  FontColor #1A1A1A
}

actor "Developer" as dev #FDF6E3

rectangle "Host web application\n(React 18/19)" as host #D6E4F0

package "Lightning Bug (browser)" #F7FBFF {
  rectangle "<b>Editor</b> React component\n(:libs target)" as editor #4F86C6
  rectangle "Tree-Sitter\ngrammars + core (WASM)" as wasm #E4DFF0
  rectangle "In-memory DataScript DB\n(per Workspace)" as ds #F5E0C3
}

cloud "Language Server\n(e.g. rholang-language-server)" as lsp #D4EDD0

dev --> host : interacts
host --> editor : embeds `<Editor>` (props, ref, RxJS events)
editor --> wasm : loads grammar,\nparses & highlights
editor --> ds : reads/writes\ndocuments, diagnostics, symbols
editor <--> lsp : LSP over **ws://** (JSON-RPC):\ndidOpen/didChange/…, diagnostics, symbols

note bottom of lsp
  Optional. Absent ⇒ the editor still
  runs (syntax only, graceful degradation).
end note
@enduml
